# Trust My Card — platform-wide configuration templates
#
# Per-environment templates live in:
#   env/profiles/development/
#   env/profiles/production/
#
# Copy the relevant profile's platform.env.example → platform.env and fill secrets.
# The shared loader (config/load-env.mjs) reads:
#   1. config/platform.env (this file when copied to config/platform.env)
#   2. env/profiles/$TMC_ENV/platform.env (profile overlay)
#
# See docs/infrastructure/environments.md
#
# --- Meta Pixel (wallet app) — single source of truth in config/platform.env ---
# Loads when TMC_ENV=production, META_PIXEL_ID is set, and NEXT_PUBLIC_APP_URL origin matches META_PIXEL_APP_URL.
# META_PIXEL_APP_URL=https://mytrustvisa.cards
# META_PIXEL_ID=
